#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:1
msgid ""
"**Warning**   \n"
"This program is [**experimental**](../../development/experimental-features."
"md#xp-feature-nix-command) and its interface is subject to change."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:8
msgid "`nix store prefetch-file` - download a file into the Nix store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:12
msgid "`nix store prefetch-file` \\[_option_...\\] _url_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:16
msgid "Download a file to the Nix store:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:18
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix store prefetch-file https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.10/"
"nix-2.3.10.tar.xz\n"
"Downloaded 'https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.10/nix-2.3.10.tar.xz' to\n"
"'/nix/store/vbdbi42hgnc4h7pyqzp6h2yf77kw93aw-source' (hash\n"
"'sha256-qKheVd5D0BervxMDbt+1hnTKE2aRWC8XCAwc0SeHt6s=').\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:25
msgid "Download a file and get the SHA-512 hash:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:27
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix store prefetch-file --json --hash-type sha512 \\\n"
"    https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.10/nix-2.3.10.tar.xz \\\n"
"  | jq -r .hash\n"
"sha512-6XJxfym0TNH9knxeH4ZOvns6wElFy3uahunl2hJgovACCMEMXSy42s69zWVyGJALXTI+86tpDJGlIcAySEKBbA==\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:34
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:36
msgid ""
"This command downloads the file _url_ to the Nix store. It prints out the "
"resulting store path and the cryptographic hash of the contents of the file."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:40
msgid ""
"The name component of the store path defaults to the last component of "
"_url_, but this can be overridden using `--name`."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:43
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:45
msgid "<span id=\"opt-executable\">[`--executable`](#opt-executable)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:47
msgid ""
"Make the resulting file executable. Note that this causes the resulting hash "
"to be a NAR hash rather than a flat file hash."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:49
msgid ""
"<span id=\"opt-expected-hash\">[`--expected-hash`](#opt-expected-hash)</"
"span> _hash_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:51
msgid "The expected hash of the file."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:53
msgid ""
"<span id=\"opt-hash-type\">[`--hash-type`](#opt-hash-type)</span> _hash-algo_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:55
msgid "Hash algorithm (`blake3`, `md5`, `sha1`, `sha256`, or `sha512`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:57
msgid "<span id=\"opt-json\">[`--json`](#opt-json)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:59
msgid ""
"Produce output in JSON format, suitable for consumption by another program."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:61
msgid "<span id=\"opt-name\">[`--name`](#opt-name)</span> _name_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:63
msgid ""
"Override the name component of the resulting store path. It defaults to the "
"base name of _url_."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:65
msgid "<span id=\"opt-no-pretty\">[`--no-pretty`](#opt-no-pretty)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:67
msgid ""
"Print compact JSON output on a single line, even when the output is a "
"terminal. Some commands may print multiple JSON objects on separate lines."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:72
msgid "<span id=\"opt-pretty\">[`--pretty`](#opt-pretty)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:74
msgid "Print multi-line, indented JSON output for readability."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:80
msgid "<span id=\"opt-unpack\">[`--unpack`](#opt-unpack)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-prefetch-file.md:82
msgid ""
"Unpack the archive (which must be a tarball or zip file) and add the result "
"to the Nix store."
msgstr ""

